LICENSE -- to be chosen by the author

No license has been assigned to this package yet.  The author (Vladimir Pascalutsa, Institut fuer Kernphysik,
Johannes Gutenberg-Universitaet Mainz) will choose the license before the package is published; until then the
default of copyright law applies (all rights reserved) and the package is not to be redistributed.

Notes for the choice:
  * code/code_v2 (Fortran) and the Python code are the author's own work;
  * the numerical data tables (data/, code/data/db_*.csv) are transcriptions of published experimental results
    and of the author's earlier compilations, with their sources listed in data/DATA_PROVENANCE.md;
  * the amplitude tables (amplitudes/) are outputs of the author's code.
Once chosen, add the SPDX identifier to CITATION.cff (field `license`).
